# capstone-project

Node.js internship capstone project.

## Conventions

- Use Conventional Commits for all commits
- Prefer async/await over .then() chains
- Write tests alongside new features in `/tests`
- Keep functions small and single-purpose
- Never commit secrets (`.env`); document variables in `.env.example`
